{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"The journey itself so far has certainly not been without discomfort; the first night was the worst, it was far too cramped in the cabriolet, — I moved into the side-chaise, where, however, we were four, and at every station we got a different and always a worse one. From Wittenberg it went better. — At noon we arrived in Halle, the company had diminished; I fetched Hinrichs, ate lunch, slept very well in the afternoon, — at 6 we departed for Nordhausen, only one student with me — an excellent express coach — each person took a side, the bench was like a sofa, I settled myself on it and, as you know, I am accustomed to sleeping on the sofa, slept almost the whole night. — Yesterday and the day before yesterday the most beautiful weather, — but in the first night it rained very heavily from midnight on; — always in the company of students we made the journey from Nordhausen to here yesterday from 6 in the morning."}}],"created":1795220857,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":210,"prompt_tokens":302,"total_tokens":512,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-JgCZbADujcdqKTvHFsmdE02wXx3IsQFP","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":302,"prompt_ms":405.557,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3429039735099337,"prompt_per_second":744.654882051105,"predicted_n":210,"predicted_ms":4827.596,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.09854545454545,"predicted_per_second":43.29276932038224}}